    "blocked_reasons": [
      "The PRIDE README and MaxQuant result headers establish all nine result-to-raw basename joins, but no released source maps each raw/result unit to SP-003, SP-007, or SP-011.",
      "Figure 3A reports three particle-labelled replicate triplets without the nine PRIDE raw identifiers; row ordering, intensity patterns and replicate ordering cannot be used as a crosswalk.",
      "The CC-BY source is outside the frozen CC0 cohort, and a CC-BY candidate cohort cannot be created while its unit-level map remains incomplete.",
      "Even a complete source map would remain one laboratory and would not provide the second independent study or shared frozen endpoint required for T121/T123."
    ]
